## 5. STATE MANAGEMENT AUDIT

### Store Inventory

#### [ui.store.js](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/store/ui.store.js)
```
State: { nav, presentationMode }
Actions: setNav(), togglePresentation()
```
- `nav` is **duplicated** — AppShell also has its own `useState('dashboard')` for `nav`. These are NOT in sync. `ui.store nav` is never consumed. AppShell state is consumed by [handleNav](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/app/AppShell.jsx#26-30).
- **nav state in Zustand is dead weight** — the component tree uses prop-drilled `nav`/[setNav](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/store/ui.store.js#7-8) from AppShell.

#### [assessment.store.js](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/modules/assessment/store/assessment.store.js) (in modules/)
```
State: { step, rows, flags }
Actions: setStep/next/back, setRows, updateRow, setFlags, updateFlag, resetAssessment
```
- **Dual state problem**: AppShell has its own `useState` for `rows`, `flags`, and `step`. These are the actual sources of truth for the wizard. The Zustand store exists and has the same shape, but wizard steps receive AppShell's `useState` values via props.
- [useAssessmentFlow](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/modules/assessment/hooks/useAssessmentFlow.js#3-29) hook reads from assessment.store, but wizard navigation uses `onNext`/`onBack` callbacks passed from AppShell (which update AppShell's own `useState`).
- **Result:** assessment.store is partially connected but effectively orphaned for the actual wizard flow.

#### [auth.store.js](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/store/auth.store.js)
```
State: { user, token, isAuthenticated }
Actions: login, logout
```
- **Completely unused** in the application. AppShell uses its own `useState('login')` for screen state. No component imports [auth.store.js](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/store/auth.store.js).

#### [dashboard.store.js](file:///c:/Users/Shalvin/Desktop/esg/frontend/src/store/dashboard.store.js)
- Likely minimal or placeholder. Not actively consumed in the main dashboard flow.

### State Ownership Issues
| State | Owner | Issue |
|---|---|---|
| nav | AppShell (useState) AND ui.store | DUPLICATE — ui.store.nav is dead |
| step | AppShell (useState) AND assessment.store | DUPLICATE — store orphaned |
| rows/flags | AppShell (useState) AND assessment.store | DUPLICATE — store orphaned |
| auth | auth.store | COMPLETELY UNUSED |
| presentationMode | ui.store | Correctly owned, correctly consumed |

