## 9. BACKEND READINESS AUDIT

### Frontend Assumptions Requiring Backend
| Assumption | Required Backend Logic |
|---|---|
| Org name is hardcoded | User → Organization entity in DB |
| Any credentials log in | Auth service (JWT/OAuth) |
| Scores computed frontend | Scoring API or persist computed results |
| Cert data is static | Certification standards DB |
| Actions are hardcoded | Recommendation engine or rules DB |
| Benchmarks are hardcoded | Industry benchmark dataset |
| No data persistence | Assessment save/load API |
| No history | Time-series score storage |
| Download reports are dead | PDF generation service |
| Scope 3 is 12% of Scope 2 | Real Scope 3 category tracking |

### Required API Endpoints

#### Authentication
```
POST /api/auth/login        { email, password } → { token, user }
POST /api/auth/logout
GET  /api/auth/me           → { id, name, orgId, role }
```

#### Organization
```
GET  /api/org               → { name, sector, fiscalYear, area }
PUT  /api/org               Update org profile
```

#### Assessments
```
POST /api/assessments       { rows, flags, orgId } → { id, scores }
GET  /api/assessments/:id   → { id, rows, flags, scores, createdAt }
GET  /api/assessments       → [list of past assessments]
PUT  /api/assessments/:id   Reopen and update
```

#### Scores
```
GET  /api/scores/latest     → computed scores object
GET  /api/scores/history    → [{ date, overall, energy, water, waste, gov }]
```

#### Certifications
```
GET  /api/certifications        → [{ id, name, requirements, scoring }]
GET  /api/certifications/readiness/:orgId → [{ certId, score, gaps }]
```

#### Benchmarks
```
GET  /api/benchmarks/:sector  → { avg, topQuartile, topDecile }
```

#### Reports
```
POST /api/reports/generate   { type, assessmentId } → { url }
GET  /api/reports/:id/download
```

### Backend Module Architecture (Recommended)
```
backend/
├── auth/           (JWT, sessions, roles)
├── organization/   (CRUD, sector lookup)
├── assessment/     (data ingestion, validation)
├── scoring/        (server-side calculation — mirrors frontend)
├── certification/  (standards DB, readiness computation)
├── benchmarks/     (industry data store)
├── insights/       (rule-based insight generator, server-side)
├── reports/        (PDF generation, GRI/BRSR templates)
└── emissions/      (Scope 1/2/3 per GHG Protocol)
```

### Integration Complexity Classification
| Integration | Complexity | Risk |
|---|---|---|
| Auth (JWT) | Medium | Low — standard pattern |
| Assessment save/load | Easy | Low — CRUD |
| Server-side scoring | Medium | Medium — must match frontend exactly |
| Certification readiness | Medium | Low — rule evaluation |
| History/trend data | Medium | Low — time-series CRUD |
| Real benchmarks | Hard | High — requires sourced dataset |
| PDF report generation | Hard | Medium — puppeteer/iText |
| Real Scope 3 tracking | Very Hard | High — GHG Protocol complexity |
| Multi-org / multi-user | Hard | High — permissions model |

