### What Must Go Dynamic First (Priority Order)
1. Organization context (org name, sector, fiscal year) — lowest effort, high demo value
2. Assessment persistence (save/load last assessment) — enables multi-session
3. Historical scores (trend data) — narrative continuity
4. Real certification readiness (computed from score gaps) — consistency
5. Priority actions (derived from gaps) — most impactful demo claim

### What Can Stay Mocked for Demo
- Industry benchmarks (hardcode is fine for demo)
- Scope 3 estimation (12% proxy is defensible for now)
- Report download (visible button, dead)
- Settings preferences (UI completeness only)

